{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fda291506c33286c","name":"Power Hammer","source":{"id":"source:reference-fda291506c33286c","title":"Power Hammer","revision":19541,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:09:24Z","sha256":"dfd94ff908572c0d1d3afb4c4eb392b682826a87e5f92ba10c16a9a694d81185","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19541","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Power%20Hammer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fda291506c33286c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Power Hammer is a Durasteel bludgeoning weapon with a small gravity generator located in the head. The user triggers the gravity generator on the downward end of a swing, causing the Power Hammer to hit with more power than the muscles of the wielder can impart to it (though it's difficult for the wielder to swiftly recover from a blow). This results in a weapon that can smash through armored plates or solid rock. Power Hammer were originally used by asteroid miners. They became popular melee weapons after a few conflicts early in the history of the Empire when mining companies found their possessions claimed by the Empire, and the miners fought back.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Extra damage from the use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Attack","referenceId":"reference:001392d9f8729e21"}," feat can be added to damage dealt to an object or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," with a Power Hammer. If you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Triple Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Triple_Attack","referenceId":"reference:a46348cb3be161eb"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Strike","referenceId":"reference:700a0453398913da"}," feats with a Power Hammer, you take an additional -2 penalty on attack rolls.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Power Hammer requires two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cells"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cells"}," to operate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 10 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Bludgeoning\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
